# ===== Growth OS - Conversion Engine (agent #15) =====
# The tracker that measures this site's funnel. Injected by index.html.
#
# This key is PUBLIC by design - it appears in the page source of every visitor.
# It can only append web events to one company's analytics and can read nothing,
# so it is not a secret and does not belong in a secret store.
#
# Where it comes from: Growth OS -> Conversion Engine -> Settings -> The tracker.
# Each company has its own key; the one below is the "Ifocus" company's.
# Point this at the deployed API for production.
VITE_GROWTH_TRACKER_URL=http://localhost:8787/api/collect/ce.js?k=ck_0c9fb5e210ef71318033bd88327d4c2b
